<title>USA: TSI Inc acquires Utah company.</title>
<headline>TSI Inc acquires Utah company.</headline>
<dateline>ST. PAUL, Minn. 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>TSI Inc, a measuring instruments company, said Thursday it acquired Target Systems Inc, a $3 million Salt Lake City, Utah, company engaged in developing and manufacturing non-contact process instrumentation for materials manufacturing.</p>
<p>Financial terms were not disclosed. TSI plans to move the operations of Target Systems to St. Paul to integrate into its Process Instrumentation group. A sales and service office will remain in Salt Lake City.</p>
<p>	 ((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
